    "name": "Cult Leader Simulator",
    "steam_appid": 3453330,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453330/extras/86e09853453ce223b0f0e45cb2c2a270.poster.avif?t=1754042556\" width=616 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453330/extras/86e09853453ce223b0f0e45cb2c2a270.webm?t=1754042556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Execute Your Strategies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play strategy cards to expand your cult and turn it into a powerful organization. Every choice matters! Some moves will bring in new followers, while others might attract unwanted attention from the authorities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453330/extras/eb417395dc0463dfb195a73dafc5a7e0.poster.avif?t=1754042556\" width=616 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453330/extras/eb417395dc0463dfb195a73dafc5a7e0.webm?t=1754042556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock New Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your deck by acquiring more powerful strategies. From subtle manipulation to outright madness, each new card unlocks fresh opportunities to reshape your cult's destiny.<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453330/extras/639b175c0eb1f63bb0d11609ac60324b.poster.avif?t=1754042556\" width=616 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453330/extras/639b175c0eb1f63bb0d11609ac60324b.webm?t=1754042556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage the Risk</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions won\u2019t go unnoticed. Keep an eye on police interest, balance your decisions wisely, and don\u2019t let an untimely investigation bring your grand plan crashing down. <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453330/extras/b20fd11ca402870b639aa63fe15dfd4e.poster.avif?t=1754042556\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453330/extras/b20fd11ca402870b639aa63fe15dfd4e.webm?t=1754042556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather Followers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cult is nothing without its believers. Recruit new members, maintain their devotion, and decide whether they are mere pawns in your game or the foundation of something greater.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453330/extras/8ebfb94732d84a4665f7d0d376ad3122.poster.avif?t=1754042556\" width=616 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453330/extras/8ebfb94732d84a4665f7d0d376ad3122.webm?t=1754042556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Power</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you become a revered prophet leading your followers to enlightenment, or a ruthless mastermind controlling their every move? Your decisions will shape the fate of your cult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453330/extras/85b86b31cec50761a020d00c9f84f3e2.poster.avif?t=1754042556\" width=616 height=261 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453330/extras/85b86b31cec50761a020d00c9f84f3e2.webm?t=1754042556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453330/extras/86e09853453ce223b0f0e45cb2c2a270.poster.avif?t=1754042556\" width=616 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453330/extras/86e09853453ce223b0f0e45cb2c2a270.webm?t=1754042556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Execute Your Strategies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play strategy cards to expand your cult and turn it into a powerful organization. Every choice matters! Some moves will bring in new followers, while others might attract unwanted attention from the authorities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453330/extras/eb417395dc0463dfb195a73dafc5a7e0.poster.avif?t=1754042556\" width=616 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453330/extras/eb417395dc0463dfb195a73dafc5a7e0.webm?t=1754042556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock New Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your deck by acquiring more powerful strategies. From subtle manipulation to outright madness, each new card unlocks fresh opportunities to reshape your cult's destiny.<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453330/extras/639b175c0eb1f63bb0d11609ac60324b.poster.avif?t=1754042556\" width=616 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453330/extras/639b175c0eb1f63bb0d11609ac60324b.webm?t=1754042556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage the Risk</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions won\u2019t go unnoticed. Keep an eye on police interest, balance your decisions wisely, and don\u2019t let an untimely investigation bring your grand plan crashing down. <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453330/extras/b20fd11ca402870b639aa63fe15dfd4e.poster.avif?t=1754042556\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453330/extras/b20fd11ca402870b639aa63fe15dfd4e.webm?t=1754042556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather Followers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cult is nothing without its believers. Recruit new members, maintain their devotion, and decide whether they are mere pawns in your game or the foundation of something greater.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453330/extras/8ebfb94732d84a4665f7d0d376ad3122.poster.avif?t=1754042556\" width=616 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453330/extras/8ebfb94732d84a4665f7d0d376ad3122.webm?t=1754042556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Power</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you become a revered prophet leading your followers to enlightenment, or a ruthless mastermind controlling their every move? Your decisions will shape the fate of your cult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453330/extras/85b86b31cec50761a020d00c9f84f3e2.poster.avif?t=1754042556\" width=616 height=261 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453330/extras/85b86b31cec50761a020d00c9f84f3e2.webm?t=1754042556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
